cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Wenn Sie diese Transkriptionen verwenden, zitieren Sie sie bitte so. / If you use these transcriptions, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
title: "Niederdeutsche Bücher in Fraktur: diplomatische Transkriptionen"
abstract: >-
  Diplomatic transcriptions of books in Low German printed in Fraktur, re-OCRed
  from the scans and checked by hand against them: Bernhard Topp, Ganne Nettels /
  Otto Veihwann (Osterwieck 1884, Eastphalian), with a Typst setting.
authors:
  - name: "just-a-book-archivist"
repository-code: "https://github.com/just-a-book-archivist/low-german-fraktur-books"
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
keywords:
  - Low German
  - Niederdeutsch
  - Plattdeutsch
  - Eastphalian
  - Fraktur
  - diplomatic transcription
